138: ## Assumptions
139: 
140: - The farmer already has an account, is logged in, and has at least one farm record. Onboarding, authentication, and farm record creation are out of scope for this feature.
141: - Weather data is available via the same source used by the Weather Advisory feature (Feature #3).
142: - Market price data is available via the same source used by the Mandi Price Tracker feature (Feature #4).
143: - Soil health data is sourced from a government-provided soil health dataset (Pakistan Soil Health Card programme or equivalent). Actual API availability and reliability will be confirmed during research.
