175: - The revenue chart exposes `role="img"` + `aria-label` summarising each crop's revenue, is keyboard-focusable, and respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.
176: - On missing/extreme data the chart falls back to a plain HTML table + text list; the page never crashes.
